ow-step-complete\", operation=sid, started_at=_t_step)","search_files for `workflow-step-start` / `workflow-step-complete` returns ONLY the interpreter.py source lines — no test references either phase.","tests/unit/test_llm_keepalive.py asserts phases `llm-call-start`, `tool-call-start`, `tool-call-complete` only (lines 65, 93, 147, 149) — never `workflow-step-start`/`workflow-step-complete`.","src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py:511-514: `try:` / `result = _dispatch(...)` / `finally:` / `emit_keepalive(\"workflow-step-complete\", ...)`","tests/unit/test_llm_keepalive.py has no test in which the dispatched/wrapped call raises — `_WrappedToolset` and `_SlowWrappedToolset` both `return \"ok\"`; `_call_with_keepalive`'s finally-on-exception path is likewise never exercised."],"finding":"The new workflow-step keepalive emissions in interpreter.py (workflow-step-start at line 509 and workflow-step-complete at line 514) have no test. These are newly added (+) lines; a regression that dropped either emission — or reordered them relative to step_identity — would not be caught. The keepalive test module covers the runner llm-call-start and tool-call phases but never drives a workflow step.","id":"3","impact":0.36,"location":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/interpreter.py:509","norm_id":"nd4c3bdd7e7500037","priority":0.36,"reason":"default-advisory","standing":{"origin_decision":"advisory","origin_revision":"d7e669004aca9bcf637668524480c132c406e84d","state":"still-present"},"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_att